    <section class="workspace"><article class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2 id="formTitle">Fuerza eléctrica entre dos cargas</h2><span class="formula" id="formula">F = k · |q₁ · q₂| / r²</span></div><form id="calculator" novalidate></form></article><aside class="card"><div class="result" id="result" aria-live="polite"><div class="placeholder">Elige un método, completa sus datos y presiona <b>Calcular</b>.<br><br>La constante de Coulomb usada es k = 8.987 551 7923 × 10⁹ N·m²/C².</div></div></aside></section>
